#41398
The Chiseled Stone Steps~
A set of steps chiseled from a dull colored stone lead up to a small room or
down to the catacombs of the Samsera Vaults.  The walls leading down are also
carved out of the stone, making it difficult or impossible to use any other
entrance other than the front door.  Rumors have been spread about bandits
attempting to tunnel into the vault system, it seems unlikely they would have
any success.    
~
413 12 0 0 0 0 255 0
D4
~
~
0 0 41301
D5
~
~
0 0 41397
S
#41399
The Chamber of Specialization~
You are in a circular room atop the Samsera Vaults.  Above you, the roof is
a lightly coloured glass dome, casting subtle rainbow colours over everything
in the room.  The only features within the room are the stairs leading down
to the vaults, and a semicircular desk facing the stairwell.  The desk is
bare except for a small &10sign&00.
~
413 136 0 0 0 0 255 0
D5
~
~
0 0 41301
E
sign~
&00
Instructions on renaming equipment:
&00
1) Have the object you wish to rename in your inventory
2) Have 1mil gold on hand, and have 15 quest points to give up
3) Type "rename object new name"
&00
For example:
4035H 4042M 191V 0 > rename mace &&0008&08Imhotep's Rage&&0000&00
Spencer the Specializer takes Glinting gnome mace from you and waves his hands!
Spencer the Specializer gives you Imhotep's Rage!
&00
&14&15CAUTION&00
This is an at-your-own-risk affair!  If you are not happy with the result, or
you accidentally rename the wrong object, tough!  If you rename an object to
something offensive, and have it taken off you, tough!
&00
If you rename a previously renamed object, the 15 qp cost is waived.

~
S
$~
